{"type": "elementor", "siteurl": "https://gototherapy.co.uk", "elements": [{"id": "dce20c4", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-section gt-section--tight gt-hero", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}}, "elements": [{"id": "351d30b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "How we verify", "header_size": "p", "_css_classes": "gt-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "49895d1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "What was checked, by whom, and when.", "header_size": "h1", "_css_classes": "gt-h1"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a0d1f13", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Gototherapy verifies each professional by having a person check their entry on their professional register, see a current insurance certificate, confirm their supervision arrangement with the supervisor in writing, and match their identity to the register entry. The checks depend on the role, are repeated every year, and are printed on the profile. Roles with no register say so in plain words.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-answer"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "51b429f", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-section gt-section--tight gt-section--flush-top", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}}, "elements": [{"id": "fd32f64", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "How does Gototherapy verify a therapist?", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "gt-h2"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0d00326", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Four checks, done by a person, in this order.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-lead"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "34f087e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<ol class=\"steps steps--4\" style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;margin:2.5rem 0 0\">\n<li class=\"step\"><p aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"numeral step__numeral\">01</p><h3 class=\"h3\">Register</h3><p class=\"step__body\">We look the person up on the register itself, not on a certificate they send us. We record the registration number and the expiry or renewal date.</p></li>\n<li class=\"step\"><p aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"numeral step__numeral\">02</p><h3 class=\"h3\">Insurance</h3><p class=\"step__body\">We see a current professional indemnity certificate and record when it expires.</p></li>\n<li class=\"step\"><p aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"numeral step__numeral\">03</p><h3 class=\"h3\">Supervision</h3><p class=\"step__body\">The therapist tells us who supervises their work. We contact the supervisor, who confirms the arrangement in writing. Nothing about clients is asked.</p></li>\n<li class=\"step\"><p aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"numeral step__numeral\">04</p><h3 class=\"h3\">Identity</h3><p class=\"step__body\">We match the person applying to the person on the register using photo identification. The image is deleted after the check.</p></li>\n</ol>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "1ce680c", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-section gt-dark", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#2B2520"}, "elements": [{"id": "9d7ccc7", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "row", "_css_classes": "gt-row", "flex_direction_tablet": "column", "flex_direction_mobile": "column", "flex_align_items": "center", "flex_gap": {"column": "48", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 48}, "flex_gap_tablet": {"column": "32", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 32}}, "elements": [{"id": "abef543", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-col", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 50.0}, "width_tablet": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "e811010", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Per role", "header_size": "p", "_css_classes": "gt-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2c995f1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "The badge is conditional, and this is why.", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "gt-h2"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "a981a04", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-col", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 50.0}, "width_tablet": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "b5dfce8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>A counsellor is checked against a register that can strike them off. A coach has no register: anybody may use the title tomorrow morning. One badge across both would transfer the credibility of the regulated professions onto the unregulated ones. So the badge says what was checked for that role, and nothing more.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-lead"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "e90a88d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"table-wrap\" style=\"background:transparent;border-color:var(--line-on-dark)\">\n<table class=\"table\" style=\"color:var(--on-navy)\">\n<thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" style=\"background:rgba(243,239,232,.06);color:var(--on-navy-mute)\">Role</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"background:rgba(243,239,232,.06);color:var(--on-navy-mute)\">Checks required</th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"background:rgba(243,239,232,.06);color:var(--on-navy-mute)\">The badge says</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Therapist</th><td>Register, expiry, insurance, supervision, identity</td><td>Register, insurance and supervision checked</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Supervisor</th><td>Register, expiry, insurance, identity, supervision training</td><td>Register, insurance and supervision training checked</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Coach or wellbeing practitioner</th><td>Insurance, identity</td><td>Insurance and identity checked, plus the caveat</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Trainer</th><td>Register, expiry, insurance, identity</td><td>Register and insurance checked</td></tr>\n<tr><th scope=\"row\">Training provider</th><td>Insurance, identity, course accreditation</td><td>Course accreditation and insurance checked, plus the caveat</td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "519448f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<blockquote class=\"pullquote\" style=\"margin-top:3rem\"><p>“This is not a regulated profession in the UK, so there is no register to check.”</p><cite>Printed on every unregulated profile. Styled as a fact, never as a warning against the practitioner.</cite></blockquote>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b2fc679", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Holding two roles means meeting both standards. A therapist who is also a coach does not get to drop the register check.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-soft"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}, {"id": "aa7f3b4", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-section", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}}, "elements": [{"id": "4e3c02e", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "row", "_css_classes": "gt-row", "flex_direction_tablet": "column", "flex_direction_mobile": "column", "flex_align_items": "center", "flex_gap": {"column": "48", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 48}, "flex_gap_tablet": {"column": "32", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 32}}, "elements": [{"id": "5c2011b", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-col gt-prose", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 50.0}, "width_tablet": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "e2b27c8", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "What does therapist verification mean, and what does it not mean?", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "gt-h2"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "af66662", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Verification means the checks above were completed on a stated date. It means the person is who they say they are, holds the registration they claim, is insured, and is supervised. It is printed with the date it was done and the date the next annual recheck is due.</p>", "_css_classes": ""}, "elements": []}, {"id": "59bbc47", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>It does not mean Gototherapy recommends the person, that they are right for you, or that anyone has assessed the quality of their work. Nobody can check that from documents, and we do not claim to.</p>", "_css_classes": ""}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1fb3be2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "What happens every year?", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "gt-h2"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4a0b803", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Every check is repeated. We track the expiry dates of registrations and insurance policies and email members before they lapse. If a document expires and is not renewed, the profile is hidden until it is. The verification history on a member's account shows each check and recheck.</p>", "_css_classes": ""}, "elements": []}, {"id": "16f688d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "What if a register entry changes?", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "gt-h2"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "3e481a6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Members agree to tell us if their registration, insurance or supervision changes. If a register entry is suspended or removed, or a check cannot be completed, the badge is removed and the profile is hidden. <a href=\"/complaints/\">How to tell us about a concern</a>.</p>", "_css_classes": ""}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "e61572b", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-col", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 50.0}, "width_tablet": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "1018f13", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "_css_classes": "gt-card", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "unit": "px", "size": 20}}, "elements": [{"id": "ef2c328", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>What a verified profile shows</p>", "_css_classes": ""}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a72c5e5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<ul class=\"verify-list\" style=\"margin-top:1rem\">\n<li class=\"verify-list__item verify-list__item--ok\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><div><span class=\"verify-list__label\">Professional register: checked</span><span class=\"verify-list__note\">Register entry checked by a person · checked [date] · expires [date]</span></div></li>\n<li class=\"verify-list__item verify-list__item--ok\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><div><span class=\"verify-list__label\">Insurance: checked</span><span class=\"verify-list__note\">Certificate seen · expires [date]</span></div></li>\n<li class=\"verify-list__item verify-list__item--ok\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><div><span class=\"verify-list__label\">Supervision: checked</span><span class=\"verify-list__note\">Supervisor confirmed in writing</span></div></li>\n<li class=\"verify-list__item verify-list__item--ok\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><div><span class=\"verify-list__label\">Identity: checked</span><span class=\"verify-list__note\">Matched to register entry</span></div></li>\n</ul>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b77518b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Dates are inserted from the verification record at render time, never typed.</p>", "_css_classes": "gt-meta"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "fc5e740", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "row", "_css_classes": "gt-actions", "flex_direction_tablet": "row", "flex_direction_mobile": "row", "flex_align_items": "center", "flex_gap": {"column": "12", "row": "12", "unit": "px", "size": 12}, "flex_gap_tablet": {"column": "32", "row": "32", "unit": "px", "size": 32}, "flex_wrap": "wrap"}, "elements": [{"id": "4a069e3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Find a verified therapist", "link": {"url": "/find-a-therapist/", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "", "size": "md"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "fab8c3b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Apply as a professional", "link": {"url": "/join/", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "gt-button-ghost", "size": "md"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": false}]}